                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 16948/37.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Thompson
                        to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-07-14"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 14,
                    1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Thompson says that all legal process in the Juan de Dios Rodriguez case
                    having ended he has informed sheriff that the prisoner can be had.</p>
            </div>
